---
layout: base.njk
title: Staffing
description: Staff augmentation, fractional technology leadership, dedicated squads, and targeted training. Add senior specialists on your schedule, shaped to your roadmap.
permalink: /staffing/
---

{% set accent = "var(--color-pixel-green)" %}

<section class="section pt-20 md:pt-28 pb-16 md:pb-24">
  <div class="wrapper grid-edit">
    <div class="col-span-12">
      <h1 class="font-display font-medium text-hero leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.035em] text-balance reveal-mask">
        <span>Specialists</span>
        <span class="block italic" style="color: {{ accent }}">on your schedule.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 md:mt-10 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl text-ink-secondary reveal reveal-delay-2 pretty">
        Snowflake specialists, fractional CTOs, and ML engineers. Placed for the work you have, for exactly as long as your roadmap needs them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section border-t border-ink-primary">
  <div class="wrapper">
    {% set staffingServices = [
      { slug: "staff-augmentation",            num: "01", title: "Staff Augmentation",              blurb: "Individual specialists on contract, contract-to-hire, or direct placement. Data engineers, cloud architects, ML specialists, DevOps, analytics engineers, QA leads. Placements in 2 to 3 weeks." },
      { slug: "fractional-leadership",         num: "02", title: "Fractional Tech Leadership",      blurb: "Fractional CTO, Head of Data, Head of Security, Head of ML. Strategy and operating discipline on a monthly retainer." },
      { slug: "executive-search",              num: "03", title: "Executive Search",                blurb: "Retained search for senior technology hires. CTO, VP of Engineering, Head of Data, Head of Security. Sourced, screened, shortlisted." },
      { slug: "dedicated-squads",              num: "04", title: "Dedicated Squads",                blurb: "A cross-functional pod shaped to your backlog. Tech lead plus engineers plus analyst. Team as a service, committed by quarter, scaled up or down with your roadmap." },
      { slug: "offshore-development-centers",  num: "05", title: "Offshore Development Centers",    blurb: "A dedicated offshore or nearshore team of 8 to 50 engineers, committed by the year. US-based leadership layer, long-tenured engineers, one team over years." },
      { slug: "training",                      num: "06", title: "Training & Enablement",           blurb: "Short, practical programs. Modern data stack, cloud fundamentals, AI in production, Salesforce administration. Your team, our curriculum, measurable outcomes." }
    ] %}

    <ul>
      {% for svc in staffingServices %}
        <li class="reveal reveal-delay-{{ (loop.index0 % 4) + 1 }}">
          <a href="/staffing/{{ svc.slug }}/" class="group flex items-start gap-5 md:gap-8 py-8 md:py-10 border-t border-ink-primary {% if loop.last %}border-b{% endif %} transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-bg-subtle">
            <span class="meta pt-2 text-ink-secondary shrink-0">{{ svc.num }}</span>
            <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:gap-14">
              <h3 class="font-display font-medium text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-[2.25rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] lg:w-[44%] lg:shrink-0 min-w-0 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="shrink-0" style="display:inline-block;width:.625rem;height:.625rem;background: {{ accent }}"></span>
                {{ svc.title }}
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-3 lg:mt-0 lg:flex-1 min-w-0 text-ink-secondary pretty">{{ svc.blurb }}</p>
            </div>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="mt-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h12m0 0L9 3m5 5l-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"/></svg>
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-statement">
  <div class="wrapper grid-edit">
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-5">
      <span class="meta section-number reveal" style="--accent: var(--color-pixel-cyan); color: var(--color-ink-inverse-secondary)">Roles we fill most</span>
      <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.025em] mt-6 balance reveal">
        Specialty talent.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-ink-inverse-secondary max-w-md pretty reveal reveal-delay-1">
        We place the hard-to-hire specialists your roadmap calls for. Our lane is specialty skills that come and go with projects.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-7 md:pl-8">
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-x-6 gap-y-4 reveal reveal-delay-2">
        {% for role in ["Snowflake engineer", "Databricks architect", "Salesforce architect", "SAP FICO consultant", "ML engineer", "MLOps engineer", "Data platform lead", "Cloud security architect", "Fractional CTO", "Head of Data (fractional)", "DevOps lead", "Analytics engineer"] %}
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-ink-inverse">
            <span class="shrink-0" style="display:inline-block;width:.375rem;height:.375rem;background: var(--color-pixel-green)"></span>
            {{ role }}
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
